treatment.emerging:
Emerging/Investigational: IL-1 blockade (anakinra,
canakinumab) for autoinflammatory amyloidosis;
eprodisate (anti-fibrillogenesis) — not approved

treatment.standardOfCare:
• IVIG (high dose, 1–2 g/kg) — immunomodulation;
neutralizes DSA; reduces complement activation;
cornerstone of AMR therapy
• Plasma exchange / plasmapheresis — rapid DSA
removal; typically 5–10 exchanges; combined with IVIG
